> This parameter is supported only when DiskCategory is set to cloud_auto. For more information, see [ESSD AutoPLs](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/ecs/user-guide/essd-autopl-disks).', example='true', position='Query'),
  clientToken?: string(name='ClientToken', description='Ensures the idempotence of the request. You can generate a parameter value from your client to ensure that the value is unique across different requests. The ClientToken parameter only supports ASCII characters and cannot exceed 64 characters in length. For more information, see [How to ensure idempotence](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/25693.html).', example='123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426655440000', position='Query'),
