- false (default): sends a Normal request. If the check succeeds, a 2XX HTTP status code is returned and the actual operation is performed.', example='true', position='Query'),
  encrypted?: boolean(name='Encrypted', description='Specifies whether the new cloud disk is encrypted. Valid values:
