Default value: false.', example='false', position='Query'),
  kmsKeyId?: string(name='KmsKeyId', description='The KMS key ID used by the new cloud disk.', example='key-szz67b2f696f4wh9yeg5d', position='Query'),
  multiAttach: string(name='MultiAttach', description='Specifies whether to enable the multi-attach feature for the new cloud disk. Valid values:

- Disabled: disables the feature.
- Enabled: enables the feature. Only ESSDs support this value.

This parameter is required.', example='Disabled', position='Query'),
  ownerId?: long(name='OwnerId', position='Query'),
