Default value: 1.', example='1'),
    cpuOptions?: {
      core?: int32(name='Core', description='The number of CPU cores.

Default value: For more information, see [Customize CPU options](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/ecs/user-guide/specify-and-view-cpu-options).', example='2'),
      threadsPerCore?: int32(name='ThreadsPerCore', description='The number of threads per core. The number of vCPUs of the ECS instance = Value of CpuOptions.Core × Value of CpuOptions.ThreadsPerCore.

A value of 1 for CpuOptions.ThreadsPerCore indicates that CPU hyper-threading is disabled.

Only specific instance types support the configuration of the number of threads per core.

Valid values and default value: For more information, see [Customize CPU options](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/ecs/user-guide/specify-and-view-cpu-options).', example='2'),
    }(name='CpuOptions', description='The CPU configurations.'),
    imageOptions?: {
      loginAsNonRoot?: boolean(name='LoginAsNonRoot', description='Specifies whether the instance that uses this image supports logons by using the ecs-user username. Valid values:
- true: yes.
- false: no.', example='false'),
