- For other instances such as Linux instances: The hostname must be 2 to 64 characters in length and can contain multiple periods (.). The string between two consecutive periods is a segment, which can contain uppercase and lowercase letters, digits, and hyphens (-).', example='LocalHostName', position='Query'),
  hpcClusterId?: string(name='HpcClusterId', description='The ID of the HPC cluster to which the instance belongs.', example='hpc-bp67acfmxazb4p****', position='Query'),
