- If you specify the Password parameter, send requests over HTTPS to prevent password leaks.
- For Windows instances, the password cannot start with a forward slash (/).
- Instances running certain operating systems do not support password configuration and only support key pair configuration, such as Others Linux and Fedora CoreOS.', example='TestEcs123!', position='Query'),
  passwordInherit?: boolean(name='PasswordInherit', description='Specifies whether to use the preset password of the image. When you use this parameter, leave the Password parameter empty and make sure that the selected image has a preset password.', example='false', position='Query'),
  period?: int32(name='Period', description='The subscription period of the resource. The unit is specified by PeriodUnit. This parameter is required and takes effect only when InstanceChargeType is set to PrePaid. If DedicatedHostId is specified, the subscription period cannot exceed the subscription period of the dedicated host. Valid values:

<props="china">
