> It cannot start with http:// or https://. To prevent name conflicts with automatic snapshots, it cannot start with `auto`.', example='testSnapshotName', position='Query'),
  storageLocationArn?: string(name='StorageLocationArn', description='> This parameter is not available.', example='null', position='Query'),
  tag?: [ 
    {
