  keyPairName: string(name='KeyPairName', description='The name of the key pair. The name must be unique. The name must be 2 to 128 characters in length and must start with a letter, either uppercase or lowercase, or a Chinese character. It cannot start with http:// or https://. The name can contain characters that are classified as letters in Unicode, including letters, Chinese characters, and digits. It can also contain colons (:), underscores (_), periods (.), or hyphens (-).

