- To migrate the instance to a dedicated host automatically selected by the system, you must leave this parameter empty and set the `Tenancy` parameter to host.

For more information about the automatic deployment feature, see [Features of dedicated hosts](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/118938.html).', example='dh-bp67acfmxazb4ph****', position='Query'),
  deploymentSetGroupNo?: int32(name='DeploymentSetGroupNo', description='The group number of the instance in the deployment set. This parameter is valid when the deployment set strategy of the deployment set to which the ECS instance is to be added or adjusted is the high availability strategy for deployment set groups (AvailabilityGroup). Valid values: 1 to 7.

> If you change the deployment set of an ECS instance and the deployment set strategy is `AvailabilityGroup`, the system automatically distributes ECS instances evenly among the groups when you do not specify this parameter. If you specify the current deployment set of the ECS instance, the system also redistributes the ECS instances evenly among the groups.', example='3', position='Query'),
  deploymentSetId?: string(name='DeploymentSetId', description='The ID of the deployment set.

This parameter is required when you add an ECS instance to a deployment set or change the deployment set of an ECS instance.

