- When you change ECS instance type, you must specify the dedicated host ID by setting the `DedicatedHostId` parameter.
- When you use the automatic deployment feature to migrate an ECS instance, you cannot change ECS instance type.', example='ecs.c6.large', position='Query'),
  migrationType?: string(name='MigrationType', description='Specifies whether to stop ECS instance before migrating it to the destination dedicated host. Valid values:

