- Only specific instance types support the configuration of the number of CPU threads.

<props="china">Valid values and default value: For more information, see [Customize CPU options](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/145895.html).', example='2'),
    topologyType?: string(name='TopologyType', description='The CPU topology type of the instance. Valid values:

