- DiscreteCoreToHTMapping: The hyper-threads of the same core in the CPU topology are discrete.

Default value: none.

> Only specific instance families support this parameter. For more information about the supported instance families, see [View and modify the CPU topology](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2636059.html).', example='DiscreteCoreToHTMapping'),
    enableVISST?: boolean(name='EnableVISST'),
    enableVRDT?: boolean(name='EnableVRDT'),
    nestedVirtualization?: string(name='NestedVirtualization', description='> This parameter is in invitational preview and is not available.', example='enabled'),
    turboMode?: string(name='TurboMode'),
