- If NetworkInterface.N.InstanceType is set to Primary, you cannot specify Ipv6Address.N or Ipv6AddressCount. You can only specify NetworkInterface.N.Ipv6Address.N or NetworkInterface.N.Ipv6AddressCount.', example='1', position='Query'),
  isp?: string(name='Isp', description='> This parameter is in invitational preview and is not available for public use.', example='null', position='Query'),
  keyPairName?: string(name='KeyPairName', description='The name of the key pair.
