  launchTemplateVersion?: long(name='LaunchTemplateVersion', description='The version of the launch template. If you specify LaunchTemplateId or LaunchTemplateName but do not specify the launch template version, the default version is used.', example='3', position='Query'),
  managedHostId?: string(name='ManagedHostId', description='The unique identifier of the managed host, such as mh-f2d3647ca21****.', example='mh-f2d3647ca21****', position='Query'),
  minAmount?: int32(name='MinAmount', description='The minimum quantity of ECS instances to create. Valid values: 1 to 100.

The number of created ECS instances depends on the specified Amount and MinAmount values:

- If MinAmount is not specified: Instances are created based on the Amount value. If the inventory is insufficient, the API returns a creation failure, and no instances are created.

