  - If the ECS inventory is greater than or equal to Amount: Instances are created based on the specified Amount value, and the API returns a creation success.', example='2', minimum=1, maximum=100, position='Query'),
  networkInterface?: [ 
    {
      deleteOnRelease?: boolean(name='DeleteOnRelease', description='Specifies whether to retain the ENI when the instance is released. Valid values:

